	/* <?php passive audit, disclaimer only ?> */
	// Resource timing reports a request after the browser has already made it and has no way to
	// stop one, which is exactly why disclaimer uses it: the discovered list still fills, from a
	// vantage point that cannot block anything. It also sees what the patches never could — fonts
	// and images pulled in by CSS.
